              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tripled this recipe to feed three. I ended up using small cherry tomatoes and Kraft parmesan cheese (that was all I had) in this recipe. We all enjoyed this new scrambled egg recipe. Very nice blend of flavors. I served it with homemade turkey sausage and Sugar-N-Spice (cinnamon-sugar) toast. I'll make this again."
          },
          {
