            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SLJ6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good! I really upped this recipe and made a frittata out of it.....used a carton of Eggbeaters for fat and cholestrol reasons....(equiv. to about 7-8 eggs). Also used 3 ripe tomatoes chopped, about 1/2c percorino romano cheese, garlic powder, fresh cracked pepper, a pinch of sea salt, and some dried basil and dried parsley. Will use fresh basil next time. Nice and light summer dinner. Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-05T15:03:28.533Z"
          },
          {
