              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simple and delicious - perfect for breakfast! I used fresh garlic and added just a pinch of salt. I used milk vs. water to make the eggs nice and fluffy. I added a bit of fresh basil to compliment the tomato. The Parmesan cheese was a nice touch. Very good with a side of whole grain toast and OJ! Thanks FrackFamily5 for a great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-24T09:21:32.113Z"
